# dsh-one-click-polish

Install source for DeepSeek Harness. See README.md for usage.

`dsh` resolves a bundle from a repository by its `package.json` (`dsh.bundle.patch`)
and its `index.js` / `client.js` halves. Nothing here is built or transpiled.

# Runtime state and thinking logs: real conversations, never shipped.
